  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Parking Meter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Parking Meter</h1>\n    <div class=\"meter-display\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"time-paid\" id=\"timePaid\">0:00</div>\n      <div class=\"price\" id=\"price\">$0.00</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"buttons\">\n      <button id=\"add15\" aria-label=\"Add 15 minutes\">+15 min</button>\n      <button id=\"add60\" aria-label=\"Add 60 minutes\">+60 min</button>\n      <button id=\"clear\" aria-label=\"Clear all time\">Clear</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\">Maximum 3 hours</p>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "/* Palette: #2d3142 (dark), #4f5d75 (mid), #bfc0c0 (light), #ffffff (white), #ef8354 (accent) */\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  background: #2d3142;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #4f5d75;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  width: 100%;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.meter-display {\n  background: #2d3142;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 24px 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  border: 2px solid #bfc0c0;\n}\n\n.time-paid {\n  font-size: 48px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  color: #ef8354;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.price {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: #bfc0c0;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: #bfc0c0;\n  color: #2d3142;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;\n  min-width: 100px;\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ffffff;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: scale(0.96);\n  background: #ef8354;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #ef8354;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n#clear {\n  background: #ef8354;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n#clear:hover {\n  background: #f09a6b;\n}\n\n#clear:active {\n  background: #d96e3a;\n}\n\n.note {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #bfc0c0;\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .time-paid {\n    font-size: 40px;\n  }\n  button {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    min-width: 80px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const MAX_MINUTES = 180;\nconst RATE_PER_HOUR = 2.00;\n\nlet totalMinutes = 0;\n\nconst timePaidEl = document.getElementById('timePaid');\nconst priceEl = document.getElementById('price');\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  const hours = Math.floor(totalMinutes / 60);\n  const minutes = totalMinutes % 60;\n  timePaidEl.textContent = `${hours}:${minutes.toString().padStart(2, '0')}`;\n  const price = (totalMinutes / 60) * RATE_PER_HOUR;\n  priceEl.textContent = `$${price.toFixed(2)}`;\n}\n\nfunction addMinutes(min) {\n  totalMinutes = Math.min(totalMinutes + min, MAX_MINUTES);\n  updateDisplay();\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('add15').addEventListener('click', () => addMinutes(15));\ndocument.getElementById('add60').addEventListener('click', () => addMinutes(60));\ndocument.getElementById('clear').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  totalMinutes = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nupdateDisplay();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Parking Meter\n\nA simple offline browser app that simulates a parking meter. Add 15 or 60 minutes with buttons (maximum 3 hours), view the paid time as h:mm and the price at $2.00 per hour. Clear button resets.\n\n## Features\n- Add 15-minute or 60-minute increments.\n- Maximum total time: 3 hours (180 minutes).\n- Displays time in h:mm format and price with two decimals.\n- Clear button resets to 0:00 and $0.00.\n- Keyboard-accessible and responsive down to 360px width.\n\n## Usage\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server or network required.\n\n## Tech\nPlain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No external dependencies.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
